<title>POLAND: BORYSZEW NET RISES IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>BORYSZEW NET RISES IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.28 vs   0.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.45 vs   0.27</p>
